{"2278950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stars of Icarus", "steam_appid": 2278950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/a91081b702a31498461b0fc1aac1ae44.avif?t=1786975612\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/81d16cb18ed777f05cf4645873f10409.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/81d16cb18ed777f05cf4645873f10409.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stars of Icarus is the continuation of a decade-long legacy. Guns of Icarus Online pioneered the crew-based PvP airship experience back in 2012. Stars of Icarus is the next chapter, providing a modernized experience of the classic multiplayer PvP experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a crew of five to face off against each other. Choose your ship, join your squadron, customize your loadout, and become the Frontier’s most lethal crew. Will you master the stars or go out in a blaze of glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/624a73212536005122e16895da308a22.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/624a73212536005122e16895da308a22.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/624a73212536005122e16895da308a22.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/ca31dbfa30419336c3c8ec2030930073.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/ca31dbfa30419336c3c8ec2030930073.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every pre-game lobby, you’ll get to select from six ships and over 25 variations of fleet formations. Choose between solo fighters, two-seater corvettes or bring in the big guns with a three-manned frigate. Each arena adds its own twists and turns to your engagements with dynamic environments. Use your team’s experience to your advantage or fall victim to their unforgiving nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e2ce9f69bc033d6fe8a187a28c6f88f9.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e2ce9f69bc033d6fe8a187a28c6f88f9.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e2ce9f69bc033d6fe8a187a28c6f88f9.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/04356d0f878a95ce2c6addd50920aad8.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/04356d0f878a95ce2c6addd50920aad8.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within your ship, you’ll need to choose your specialty. Whether you take responsibility for navigating the cosmic fog, manning the cannons to wipe out enemy ships, or ensuring the shields and engines hold – when the ship goes down, the crew goes down with it. Customize your character loadouts to hold specialist tools to ensure you can get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/5d23abf17fda9120ea0b6a21cc5c1885.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/5d23abf17fda9120ea0b6a21cc5c1885.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/5d23abf17fda9120ea0b6a21cc5c1885.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/4895cad8a07b97bb69ad9ef9a858e650.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/4895cad8a07b97bb69ad9ef9a858e650.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a variety of engineering tools, arm your ship with different weapons and ammo types, and experiment with a range of ship skills and jump drives depending on your fleet composition. Access the full armory of weapons and equipment from the get-go, and discover your favorite loadout. No grinding. No pay-to-win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/cbf0da650d9e7cd82af06df01c968ade.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/cbf0da650d9e7cd82af06df01c968ade.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/cbf0da650d9e7cd82af06df01c968ade.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/dfd56ad68502d6e2922cea4dca68b7f9.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/dfd56ad68502d6e2922cea4dca68b7f9.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Stars of Icarus in your own way - jump into competitive modes or kick back for the evening to hang out with friends in custom lobbies and servers. Tell tales of your narrow escape from enemy fire, drifting through asteroid fields with half an engine and a broken antenna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/6febbb2b7f9db294a17aaf6701375c4b.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/6febbb2b7f9db294a17aaf6701375c4b.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/6febbb2b7f9db294a17aaf6701375c4b.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/81d16cb18ed777f05cf4645873f10409.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/81d16cb18ed777f05cf4645873f10409.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stars of Icarus is the continuation of a decade-long legacy. Guns of Icarus Online pioneered the crew-based PvP airship experience back in 2012. Stars of Icarus is the next chapter, providing a modernized experience of the classic multiplayer PvP experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a crew of five to face off against each other. Choose your ship, join your squadron, customize your loadout, and become the Frontier’s most lethal crew. Will you master the stars or go out in a blaze of glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/624a73212536005122e16895da308a22.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/624a73212536005122e16895da308a22.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/624a73212536005122e16895da308a22.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/ca31dbfa30419336c3c8ec2030930073.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/ca31dbfa30419336c3c8ec2030930073.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every pre-game lobby, you’ll get to select from six ships and over 25 variations of fleet formations. Choose between solo fighters, two-seater corvettes or bring in the big guns with a three-manned frigate. Each arena adds its own twists and turns to your engagements with dynamic environments. Use your team’s experience to your advantage or fall victim to their unforgiving nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e2ce9f69bc033d6fe8a187a28c6f88f9.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e2ce9f69bc033d6fe8a187a28c6f88f9.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/e2ce9f69bc033d6fe8a187a28c6f88f9.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/04356d0f878a95ce2c6addd50920aad8.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/04356d0f878a95ce2c6addd50920aad8.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within your ship, you’ll need to choose your specialty. Whether you take responsibility for navigating the cosmic fog, manning the cannons to wipe out enemy ships, or ensuring the shields and engines hold – when the ship goes down, the crew goes down with it. Customize your character loadouts to hold specialist tools to ensure you can get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/5d23abf17fda9120ea0b6a21cc5c1885.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/5d23abf17fda9120ea0b6a21cc5c1885.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/5d23abf17fda9120ea0b6a21cc5c1885.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/4895cad8a07b97bb69ad9ef9a858e650.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/4895cad8a07b97bb69ad9ef9a858e650.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a variety of engineering tools, arm your ship with different weapons and ammo types, and experiment with a range of ship skills and jump drives depending on your fleet composition. Access the full armory of weapons and equipment from the get-go, and discover your favorite loadout. No grinding. No pay-to-win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/cbf0da650d9e7cd82af06df01c968ade.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/cbf0da650d9e7cd82af06df01c968ade.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/cbf0da650d9e7cd82af06df01c968ade.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/dfd56ad68502d6e2922cea4dca68b7f9.avif?t=1786975612\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras_big/dfd56ad68502d6e2922cea4dca68b7f9.webp?t=1786975612 width=1560 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Stars of Icarus in your own way - jump into competitive modes or kick back for the evening to hang out with friends in custom lobbies and servers. Tell tales of your narrow escape from enemy fire, drifting through asteroid fields with half an engine and a broken antenna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/6febbb2b7f9db294a17aaf6701375c4b.poster.avif?t=1786975612\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/6febbb2b7f9db294a17aaf6701375c4b.webm?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2278950/extras/6febbb2b7f9db294a17aaf6701375c4b.mp4?t=1786975612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "From the devs of Guns of Icarus comes the ultimate spaceship PvP experience. Captain frigates, pilot fighters, and man the guns. In the forgotten arenas of space, communication with your crew is key. Victory or death, together.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“As someone who’s played a lot of Guns of Icarus Online and TIE Fighter and read the X-Wing novels, this truly is more of that adrenaline-fueled starfighter combat gameplay with intense portions of hide-and-seek mixed in that veterans of the series and sci-fi fans in general crave.”<br>DBLTAP<br><br>“Coordinating your efforts works on multiple levels, both in terms of ensuring that your ships stay together and can support one another, taking a tactical approach to engaging the enemy, but also within a ship...It’s really satisfying to have it all come together.”<br>TheSixthAxis<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app